        <mxCell id="infinigraph_future_c48" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#94a3b8;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1e293b;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;" value="&lt;b&gt;Without Infinigraph (vertical path)&lt;/b&gt;: 3 × x2iedn.24xlarge (3 TiB) primaries + GDS secondary hold a ~3 TB store in one machine&#39;s page cache. Simpler to run, and the default until the trigger is met." vertex="1">
